>TCVN_CS_OPENING</Text><Enum>3</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is establishing the connection to the camera. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_OPENED</Text><Enum>4</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The connection to the camera has been established and the camera controller is ready to start the image acquisition. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_STARTACQUISITION</Text><Enum>5</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is starting the image acquisition. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_ACQUIRING</Text><Enum>6</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera is sending images (either streaming or manually triggered, depending on the configuration). ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_STOPACQUISITION</Text><Enum>7</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is stopping the image acquisition. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_RESETTINGFEATURES</Text><Enum>8</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is resetting the features on the camera. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_TRIGGERING</Text><Enum>9</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is processing a softwaretrigger. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><EnumInfo><Text>TCVN_CS_CLOSING</Text><Enum>10</Enum><Comment><![CDATA[ The camera controller is closing the connection to the camera. ]]></Comment></EnumInfo><Properties><Property><Name>Namespace</Name><Value>Tc3_Vision</Value></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name Namespace="CoreVision">I_ImageSource</Name><BitSize>64</BitSize><ExtendsType GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-000000000018}">PVOID</ExtendsType><Method><Name>__getState</Name><ReturnType Namespace="Tc3_Vision">ETcVnCameraState</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>32</ReturnBitSize><Properties><Property><Name>property</Name></Property></Properties></Method><Method><Name>GetCurrentImage</Name><ReturnType GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-000000000019}">HRESULT</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>32</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>Image</Nam